&control
  calculation='vc-relax', prefix='Si', outdir='/root/work/COMP-PH/Si/relax', pseudo_dir='/root/pseudo/sg15', tprnfor=.true., tstress=.true., etot_conv_thr=1d-7, forc_conv_thr=1d-5
/
&system
  ibrav=2, celldm(1)=10.263, nat=2, ntyp=1, ecutwfc=60
/
&electrons
  conv_thr=1.0d-12, mixing_beta=0.7
/
&ions
/
&cell
  press_conv_thr=0.05
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
  Si 28.0855 Si_ONCV_PBE-1.2.upf
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
  Si 0 0 0
  Si 0.25 0.25 0.25
K_POINTS automatic
  12 12 12 0 0 0
